* DE-DRMS Variant A — CURR_DIS disable/enable transient (linear opamp macro, gear)
.inc models.inc
V1 ta 0 3.3
Rsample ta sn 10k
Rk1 sn b 2
Vsm b dd 0
M1 dd g e e nmosb
Rs e 0 150k
R1 vset ta 360k
R2 vset 0 200k
Cf vset 0 1n
M2 vset xd 0 0 nmosb
Rg xd 0 1meg
Vdis xd 0 PULSE(0 3.3 3m 1u 1u 5m 10m)
Cg g 0 1n
Xop vset e ta 0 g opa333t
.tran 0 12m 20u
.options method=gear
.end
